# 🎯 Project Goal

The primary goal of ClassPlus is not simply to create an assignment management API.

The project demonstrates how a backend can handle asynchronous workloads and real-time events.

The important architectural separation is:

```text
HTTP Request
     │
     ▼
API Server
     │
     ▼
Queue
     │
     ▼
Background Worker
     │
     ▼
Database
     │
     ▼
Event
     │
     ▼
Pub/Sub
     │
     ▼
WebSocket
     │
     ▼
User

